Subject: x86/spec-ctrl: Rename tsa_calculations()
From: Andrew Cooper andrew.cooper3@citrix.com Fri Nov 7 15:00:32 2025 +0000
Date: Tue Nov 10 18:09:57 2026 +0000:
Git: de7673b5a13dd92dfd65a86c723f192efbbc4246

... and adjust some comments in preparation to cope with the second TSA
variant.

No functional change.

This is part of XSA-525.

Signed-off-by: Andrew Cooper <andrew.cooper3@citrix.com>
Acked-by: Roger Pau Monné <roger@xenproject.org>
